The combat folder contains all systems and utilities for managing opponent conditions and statuses within the game's combat mechanics. It handles everything from defining condition thresholds and visual representations to analyzing combat logs for status detection. These components work together to provide the core combat feedback system that players experience during battles. opponentStatusStore.ts additionally caches the last-seen enemy UI snapshot (mirroring features/room/roomDataStore.ts's pattern) so useOpponentStatus.ts can seed a fresh mount — e.g. a live HUD theme switch — instead of flashing back to "no enemy."
